From 9c990803ff7b46bd403a52130d073097b5926499 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quinn <coderquinn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:13:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(access): separate Test Profile save from activation in
 Options

Invalidate a node preview when the share field changes, reload the committed revision after discarding a stale draft, allow listener-preference-only saves against the committed Keychain reference behind the existing revision and commit fences, and admit Apply on write permission while reporting saved-but-unavailable when activation is not admitted.
